<h1>Description about project Test Guru</h1>
<p>This application for creating and passing tests with admin and user roles</p>
<p>Admin can create tests, questions, answers and categories</p>
<p>User can pass tests and see their results</p>
<p>User can see tests list and choose test to pass</p>
<p>User can see test results and see their progress</p>
<p>Created on <a href="http://www.thinknetica.com" target="_blank">Thinknetica</a> course</p>
